  - KNIFE
  - CLEAVER
  - BAT
  - AXE
  - GUN
  - SHOTGUN
  - SPRAY CAN
  - BOTTLE
  title: {fileID: 3346386288751323736}
  descriptions:
  - 'A quick weapon for close hand to hand combat. It is silent and delivers 30%
    damage for each hit '
  - 'An effective weapon for close hand to hand combat. It delivers 45% damage for
    each hit '
  - 'A lethal weapon for close hand to hand combat. Armed with nails hammered into
    the wood, this delivers 60% damage per hit '
  - 'A heavy, slow weapon for close hand to hand combat. It is lethal, delivering
    100% damage per hit '
  - 'A handgun perfect for both close and long range combat. It holds 15 bullets
    per clip. A body shot delivers 50% damage. A headshot delivers 100% damage. It
    is very loud and will attract a lot of attention '
  - 'It holds two shotgun shells, which deliver lethal attacks both at close range
    and at long range. At close range it can deliver 100% demage to multiple enemies.
    It is very loud and will attract a lot of attention '
  - 'Combine this with the lighter to create a makeshift flame thrower. It is perfect
    for close range combat '
  - Throw this to distract enemies, or combine with rags and a lighter to create
    a molotov cocktail, which is a makeshift grenade to blow up multiple enemies.
    It will make a lot of noise and attract a lot of enemies
  description: {fileID: 2673286731685273719}
